			<div class="content" id="post-content-2362258">
									

<p>I like this one. I can't really describe it beyond &quot;heatwarming and terrifying&quot;. I don't make posts often, but I read comments on this page and wanted to say something. Things go right over my head!</p>
<p>I share the interpretation that the skeleton in the van is the master they're talking about. So the guy died in the blaze of battle against a giant bug and the bug killers are able to kill it. After that, I thought they were just very angry at the insectoids they just decided to kill off non-anomalous insects. Talk about bloodthirsty and vengeful. Eh, I can work with them being incompetent, it's equally great for me.</p>
<p><span style="font-size:40%;">and that, folks, is why I feel like a black sheep of this site - I interpret things differently than others haha</span></p>

